<Layout title="About Our Mission" description="Dream Solutions Tennessee is veteran- and minority-owned, serving Nashville and Middle Tennessee with radon and crawl space solutions."><Hero eyebrow="About Dream Solutions Tennessee" title="A local company.<br />A <em>personal purpose.</em>" description="Helping Middle Tennessee homeowners understand their radon risk and take practical steps toward a healthier home." /><section class="split-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">The people behind the name</p><h2>Rooted in Nashville.<br /><em>Focused on home.</em></h2></div><div class="prose"><p>Dream Solutions Tennessee is veteran- and minority-owned. Our focus is radon testing, radon mitigation system installation, and crawl space encapsulation for Nashville and the surrounding Middle Tennessee area.</p><p>Our mission is straightforward: make radon and crawl space care easier to understand, with clear conversations and solutions shaped around each home.</p><div class="founders"><div style="grid-column: 1 / -1"><h3>Veteran &amp; Minority Owned</h3><span class="eyebrow">Proudly serving Nashville &amp; Middle Tennessee</span></div></div></div></section><section class="process-section"><p class="eyebrow">Our approach</p><h2>Clarity. Care. A practical next step.</h2><div class="process-grid"><div><h3>Start with understanding</h3><p>Know what a test result means and why a service may be right for your home.</p></div><div><h3>Consider the whole home</h3><p>Foundation type, crawl space conditions, and system layout inform the work.</p></div><div><h3>Keep it local</h3><p>A Nashville-based company serving our surrounding Middle Tennessee communities.</p></div></div></section><CallToAction /></Layout>